WEBVTT

01:04.480 --> 01:09.820
<b><i>Power - Unity</i></b>

01:28.000 --> 01:30.090
This is a joke, right!?

01:30.090 --> 01:30.880
No way!

01:43.980 --> 01:44.730
No!

01:45.730 --> 01:48.560
I've had enough, okay!?

01:56.070 --> 01:58.110
I can't even move now!

01:58.530 --> 02:01.030
Fine then,
do whatever you want!

02:02.830 --> 02:05.660
This is all fake anyway...

02:06.120 --> 02:07.830
it's just like a bad dream.

02:26.600 --> 02:27.520
Hey there.

02:28.690 --> 02:31.730
Y'know you just died, right?

02:33.980 --> 02:35.070
Emma...

02:36.070 --> 02:37.490
I'm sorry.

02:37.490 --> 02:40.070
Your powers awakened recently.

02:40.530 --> 02:42.120
There's no need to rush things.

02:43.990 --> 02:46.870
What exactly have you
been teaching her?

02:48.290 --> 02:51.500
Every one of us has to
come to grips with who we are.

02:51.500 --> 02:55.000
Learning the extent of her mutant powers
should have been first on the list.

02:55.000 --> 02:58.380
Gotta know how to flaunt it, right?

02:59.880 --> 03:02.050
Without that knowledge,

03:02.050 --> 03:05.350
mutants can become prey to people
who want to misuse their powers...

03:07.230 --> 03:08.730
Hang on!

03:08.730 --> 03:10.350
Are you talking about Emma!?

03:10.940 --> 03:18.030
I don't know what your problem is,
but Emma risked her life to save me!

03:18.030 --> 03:19.030
apologize!

03:19.030 --> 03:20.860
Tell her you're sorry!

03:20.860 --> 03:22.070
That's enough, Hisako.

03:22.070 --> 03:24.740
Why are you always
so hard on her?

03:24.740 --> 03:26.540
Tearing down one of your own,

03:26.540 --> 03:29.540
is that the X-Men's
idea of teamwork!?

03:30.620 --> 03:34.420
Emma isn't one of the X-Men,
or "one of my own."

03:34.420 --> 03:36.300
Before you criticize others,

03:36.300 --> 03:40.720
you need to prove you're
a mutant who can handle herself.

03:41.340 --> 03:43.800
A mutant who
can handle herself!?

03:43.800 --> 03:45.010
What's that supposed to mean!?

03:45.600 --> 03:47.770
I just told you,
there's no need to rush.

03:52.730 --> 03:54.440
The later risk of outbreak

03:54.440 --> 03:59.110
of Damon-Hall Syndrome due to
secondary mutation is quite high.

03:59.110 --> 04:01.950
It's just like we saw in that boy.

04:02.860 --> 04:05.370
Speed up the vaccine production.

04:05.370 --> 04:07.950
The secondary mutation
is already developing in Emma.

04:07.950 --> 04:10.200
We have no time to waste.

04:10.200 --> 04:11.080
Understood.

04:12.040 --> 04:17.840
Once everything is ready,
I'd like you all to return to Tohoku.

04:22.010 --> 04:25.180
<i>Is that the X-Men's
idea of teamwork!?</i>

04:38.190 --> 04:42.610
I've brought you all here for Hisako,
nothing else.

04:42.610 --> 04:46.030
I'd like to make her
a junior member of the X-Men.

04:46.030 --> 04:47.370
Any objections?

04:47.370 --> 04:48.160
Not at all.

04:48.160 --> 04:50.620
She has wonderful potential.

04:51.540 --> 04:56.290
Furthermore, I'd like to make Emma
a member of the X-Men.

04:56.960 --> 04:59.300
She can continue to act
as Hisako's personal tutor.

04:59.920 --> 05:01.380
Sounds good to me.

05:01.380 --> 05:04.680
She pulled out all the stops to
protect Hisako back in Japan.

05:04.680 --> 05:05.930
What do you say, Emma?

05:07.260 --> 05:08.390
I object.

05:09.220 --> 05:11.350
You still suspect me?

05:12.640 --> 05:15.650
I had nothing to do
with Jean's death.

05:15.650 --> 05:21.860
If that's so, let the Professor
perform a telepathic probe.

05:21.860 --> 05:22.820
I'd rather not.

05:23.360 --> 05:28.160
If that's what it takes to become a member,
then no thank you.

05:28.160 --> 05:28.990
Really?

05:29.870 --> 05:33.500
I'm not letting anyone rummage
around inside my mind.

05:36.500 --> 05:41.340
Hey, has Cyclops always
been a jerk like that?

05:42.210 --> 05:43.260
Scott?

05:43.260 --> 05:45.720
He's always making that
stupid grim face...

05:46.380 --> 05:48.180
He said, "Before you criticize others,

05:48.180 --> 05:53.270
you need to prove you're
a mutant who can handle herself."

05:53.810 --> 05:56.060
He's the only one
criticizing anybody!

05:56.980 --> 06:00.020
I know Emma regrets being
in the Inner Circle.

06:00.020 --> 06:07.450
Yet, isn't it just like a man to throw salt
into an open wound?

06:08.660 --> 06:12.160
Well, Scott harbors deep wounds.

06:13.330 --> 06:15.330
He won't be rid of them easily.

06:16.620 --> 06:20.540
Even now, he's struggling
to find an answer.

06:21.420 --> 06:23.340
The same way you are.

06:24.090 --> 06:26.420
I'm struggling?

06:28.380 --> 06:30.430
I won't force the issue,

06:30.430 --> 06:33.430
I don't intend to perform
a telepathic probe against her will.

06:33.430 --> 06:35.270
Thank you, Charles.

06:36.100 --> 06:39.350
Scott, Emma's membership
has been decided.

06:40.770 --> 06:42.570
I'll abide your decision, sir...

06:43.230 --> 06:43.770
But...

06:44.730 --> 06:45.280
But?

06:45.780 --> 06:50.570
If Emma betrays the team,
I refuse to bear any of the responsibility.

06:58.210 --> 07:00.630
I don't think Emma is tangled up
in Jean's death.

07:01.330 --> 07:03.130
But, for a guy like Scott,

07:03.130 --> 07:05.800
he's sure persistent in keeping
an eye on Emma.

07:05.800 --> 07:10.800
If it wasn't Emma,
who did he see back there?

07:11.680 --> 07:17.640
The leader of the Inner Circle could have
easily shown him an illusion of me.

07:17.640 --> 07:19.890
You're talking about Mastermind?

07:20.730 --> 07:21.230
Yes.

07:21.810 --> 07:26.820
I heard that even a year later,
there's no trace of him to be found.

07:28.360 --> 07:32.160
The Inner Circle have, in fact,
suspended their activities.

07:33.070 --> 07:37.040
If Mastermind does live,
those activities will no doubt resume.

07:43.790 --> 07:45.130
What is it, Scott?

07:45.840 --> 07:50.470
Hisako's been approved as
a junior member of the X-Men.

07:50.470 --> 07:52.430
We'll begin intensive
training immediately.

07:53.050 --> 07:55.260
I'm in the X-Men!?

07:55.260 --> 08:00.520
Is Emma joining us
as Hisako's trainer?

08:01.020 --> 08:01.890
That's right.

08:01.890 --> 08:03.310
Emma too!?

08:03.310 --> 08:04.980
Hisako, come along.

08:05.690 --> 08:08.440
I don't want you to teach me!

08:08.440 --> 08:10.240
Emma's my instructor.

08:10.700 --> 08:11.240
That doesn't cut it.

08:11.820 --> 08:13.160
I'm the X-Men's leader.

08:13.740 --> 08:15.240
You follow my orders.

08:31.260 --> 08:33.180
So what am I fighting now?

08:33.630 --> 08:35.390
Another giant robot?

08:35.390 --> 08:37.640
Some kind of war machine?

08:37.640 --> 08:40.350
Maybe you can pit me against
Frankenstein this time.

08:40.350 --> 08:41.480
You're fighting me.

08:41.480 --> 08:42.060
What?

08:42.640 --> 08:46.110
When you're fighting
imaginary enemies, there's no real risk.

08:46.110 --> 08:50.570
You weren't taking things seriously
last time because you felt that way.

08:50.570 --> 08:52.030
B-But...

08:52.570 --> 08:54.240
Consider me your enemy.

08:54.240 --> 08:57.160
Do not hold back,
because I won't.

08:57.160 --> 08:58.530
T-That kind of...

08:58.530 --> 08:59.620
Let's get started.

09:08.460 --> 09:09.130
Wait!

09:09.420 --> 09:11.630
I can't think of you
as my enemy!

09:12.630 --> 09:13.800
What are you doing!?

09:13.800 --> 09:14.720
That's dangerous!

09:15.050 --> 09:16.300
Is this your idea of a joke!?

09:16.300 --> 09:18.300
I'm not really known
for my sense of humor.

09:30.980 --> 09:32.740
He really meant it.

10:08.810 --> 10:09.690
You!

10:09.690 --> 10:11.690
Are you trying to kill me!?

10:11.690 --> 10:12.690
I told you.

10:12.690 --> 10:13.860
I'm not holding back.

10:15.190 --> 10:16.070
Stop!

10:16.070 --> 10:17.950
Somebody help me!

10:17.950 --> 10:19.120
Emma!

10:19.120 --> 10:20.030
Come on, now!

10:20.030 --> 10:23.990
I don't mind high impact
training, but she's just a kid!

10:23.990 --> 10:25.500
This is too much.

10:25.500 --> 10:26.460
I'm stopping it.

10:27.830 --> 10:28.670
Wait.

10:29.380 --> 10:31.000
Just a bit longer...

10:31.000 --> 10:32.500
What if it's too late?

10:32.500 --> 10:34.380
I know but...

10:35.050 --> 10:38.050
She hasn't even begun yet.

10:39.220 --> 10:40.300
Help me...

10:40.300 --> 10:41.260
please...

10:41.800 --> 10:44.470
Stop this, Cyclops!

10:45.520 --> 10:48.560
Your enemy won't stop attacking
when you ask him.

10:48.560 --> 10:52.310
If you're captured, you'll end up
just like those mutants who died.

10:53.940 --> 10:56.530
I don't want that...

10:56.530 --> 11:00.030
Then use your powers and
do something about it.

11:47.160 --> 11:49.210
What's he trying to pull!?

11:50.290 --> 11:54.080
He's trying to provoke Hisako
into losing control.

12:01.840 --> 12:02.930
Stop it...

12:03.930 --> 12:05.050
Stop it!

12:05.850 --> 12:07.510
Control your powers!

12:08.430 --> 12:09.640
Control my...

12:09.640 --> 12:10.730
Powers?

12:10.730 --> 12:16.230
You need to control them,
or else they'll totally consume you!

12:16.610 --> 12:17.480
He...

12:17.480 --> 12:18.940
He's talking about what
happened to Jean.

12:19.780 --> 12:21.490
Stay back!

12:21.490 --> 12:22.700
Don't let the power control you!

12:23.740 --> 12:24.910
Don't lose sight of yourself!

12:26.910 --> 12:27.790
Don't...

12:27.790 --> 12:29.450
don't get any closer.

12:29.450 --> 12:31.000
Don't think about
anything else!

12:32.620 --> 12:34.630
Focus on your powers!

12:50.560 --> 12:51.230
Hisako...

12:52.600 --> 12:53.730
She did it.

13:00.780 --> 13:01.820
Well done.

13:03.070 --> 13:04.530
Well done!?

13:04.530 --> 13:06.320
What was good about that!?

13:06.700 --> 13:07.950
These powers...

13:08.910 --> 13:10.290
I'm a monster!

13:16.250 --> 13:17.130
Can't really blame her.

13:18.210 --> 13:24.840
She's seen what happens if you get a secondary
mutation and then get Damon-Hall Syndrome.

13:25.430 --> 13:30.640
No wonder she considers herself a freak
with a ticking time bomb inside of her.

13:31.890 --> 13:36.480
If that's too much for her,
then she can't be in the X-Men.

13:51.700 --> 13:52.450
Ororo...

13:57.000 --> 13:58.710
May I join you?

14:25.570 --> 14:30.660
I wasn't sure what to do with
my powers at first either...

14:31.240 --> 14:35.250
People treated me differently because
of them, and I was always worrying...

14:36.160 --> 14:39.580
If I hadn't met Charles, there's no telling
what would have happened.

14:40.420 --> 14:43.960
He protected you?

14:43.960 --> 14:46.420
He didn't just protect me.

14:46.420 --> 14:50.010
He helped me reconcile my feelings,
helped me control my powers...

14:50.640 --> 14:53.350
He showed me the way.

14:55.270 --> 14:59.730
Humans and mutants may be different,
but there's one thing we can share.

15:00.400 --> 15:01.360
Our hearts.

15:02.150 --> 15:02.900
Hearts?

15:03.480 --> 15:07.780
The X-Men are a bridge between the
hearts of humans and mutants.

15:08.530 --> 15:12.950
Now I'm proud of my powers,
and to be a member of this team.

15:14.160 --> 15:17.790
I just want a normal life...

15:17.790 --> 15:19.790
To forget about these powers...

15:19.790 --> 15:23.340
You'd just be running
from your future.

15:24.710 --> 15:25.750
She's right, Hisako.

15:27.460 --> 15:29.510
That's the problem
you're having...

15:29.510 --> 15:32.430
At this rate not only will you not
master your powers,

15:32.430 --> 15:37.310
you'll probably be consumed by them,
like Cyclops is worried about.

15:38.770 --> 15:43.060
Whether you like it or not,
you were born a mutant.

15:43.810 --> 15:46.190
There's no escaping that fate.

15:46.190 --> 15:47.440
Fate?

15:47.440 --> 15:51.200
Which is why you need to accept what's
happened, strengthen your heart,

15:51.200 --> 15:53.070
and become tough enough
to deal with what's to come.

15:53.910 --> 15:55.120
I don't think I can do it.

15:55.120 --> 15:58.410
I'm not strong like you.

15:59.000 --> 16:00.710
I'm weak-hearted...

16:01.420 --> 16:02.460
I can't do it.

16:05.960 --> 16:07.050
Come along, Hisako.

16:09.920 --> 16:12.220
You're sure about this, Emma?

16:12.220 --> 16:12.680
Yes.

16:13.300 --> 16:15.470
On one condition.

16:15.470 --> 16:16.510
One condition?

16:16.510 --> 16:17.220
Yes.

16:17.220 --> 16:22.020
I want you to share everything you see
in my mind with everyone here.

16:22.020 --> 16:22.940
Everyone?

16:22.940 --> 16:23.770
Yes.

16:23.770 --> 16:25.190
Especially Hisako.

16:25.900 --> 16:26.980
Emma...

16:27.360 --> 16:27.980
Understood.

16:28.780 --> 16:30.570
Let's begin.

16:42.040 --> 16:44.040
This is Emma when
she was young.

16:44.580 --> 16:46.540
<i>That girl's so creepy...</i>

16:46.540 --> 16:49.000
<i>it's like she can tell
what you're thinking.</i>

16:49.000 --> 16:51.010
<i>And those icy eyes...</i>

16:51.010 --> 16:52.590
<i>They say she's a mutant.</i>

16:52.590 --> 16:53.840
<i>A mutant!?</i>

16:53.840 --> 16:55.800
<i>Ugh, disgusting!</i>

16:56.140 --> 16:58.350
This is during high school...

16:58.350 --> 17:01.480
<i>Why did your boyfriend break up
with you all of a sudden?</i>

17:01.480 --> 17:02.770
<i>I bet it's Emma's fault!</i>

17:02.770 --> 17:04.390
<i>She's super hot.</i>

17:04.390 --> 17:07.810
<i>Yeah, but I don't want anybody messing
with my head with telepathy...</i>

17:07.810 --> 17:11.280
This is Emma on her
twentieth birthday.

17:11.650 --> 17:13.740
<i>Miss Frost is exquisite.</i>

17:13.740 --> 17:16.030
<i>Yes, she's the perfect woman.</i>

17:16.740 --> 17:19.030
That was when she met him...

17:19.830 --> 17:21.160
Mastermind.

17:22.250 --> 17:25.580
<i>Human high society has to
be growing dull, right?</i>

17:26.380 --> 17:29.880
<i>I know where you truly belong...</i>

17:32.130 --> 17:35.590
<i>Welcome to the Inner Circle.</i>

17:37.090 --> 17:41.810
<i>But Ms. Frost, we want to handle the development
in this area as carefully as possi-</i>

17:44.230 --> 17:46.650
<i>...actually, it's a brilliant proposal.</i>

17:46.650 --> 17:48.810
<i>I'll sign the contracts immediately.</i>

17:49.400 --> 17:50.650
<i>Excellent work.</i>

17:50.650 --> 17:54.030
<i>Now we've procured all
the capital he was offering.</i>

17:54.030 --> 17:55.700
<i>I'm looking forward to
the next time.</i>

17:57.030 --> 18:00.490
Without considering what she was doing,
she continued to misuse her powers,

18:00.490 --> 18:02.410
until it drove someone
to kill himself.

18:02.910 --> 18:04.200
<i>Do you feel sorry for him?</i>

18:04.200 --> 18:07.790
<i>Some wretch who lost all hope,
and threw away their life...</i>

18:07.790 --> 18:10.130
<i>It was my fault he lost all hope.</i>

18:11.090 --> 18:13.920
<i>I've had enough of this.</i>

18:14.630 --> 18:15.550
<i>Honestly...</i>

18:15.550 --> 18:18.180
<i>are you claiming some
pretense of morality now?</i>

18:18.640 --> 18:19.760
<i>How absurd.</i>

18:20.800 --> 18:22.350
And this is one year ago,

18:23.100 --> 18:27.270
she was with a boy who had
gone through some trauma.

18:28.020 --> 18:29.690
A mutant boy.

18:30.310 --> 18:33.070
<i>You can cry as much
as you need to.</i>

18:33.820 --> 18:38.160
<i>But one day, you'll understand
what your power should be used for.</i>

18:39.660 --> 18:42.990
This was the day we were
fighting the Inner Circle.

18:44.120 --> 18:48.210
She wasn't anywhere near
the battle where Jean died.

18:49.170 --> 18:49.750
Emma...

18:51.540 --> 18:53.550
You've been proven innocent.

18:55.590 --> 18:56.630
Emma!

18:57.340 --> 18:58.930
Do you understand now, Hisako?

18:59.380 --> 19:03.260
I'm not strong,
and I'm by no means perfect.

19:04.810 --> 19:09.270
But I regret what I've done now.

19:09.810 --> 19:11.690
I changed in spite of
who I used to be,

19:11.690 --> 19:13.690
so I'm sure you can as well.

19:13.690 --> 19:15.610
I'll help you.

19:16.490 --> 19:18.650
I believe in you, Emma!

19:18.650 --> 19:20.570
I'll try hard as an X-Man!

19:27.040 --> 19:28.040
Sorry...

19:28.660 --> 19:29.580
for everything.

19:30.460 --> 19:33.790
I guess we're teammates
as of today, Cyclops.

19:34.340 --> 19:36.960
Or would you rather
I call you Scott?

19:38.220 --> 19:39.220
It's Cyclops.

19:40.050 --> 19:42.140
Well, it's a pleasure.

19:48.770 --> 19:54.230
The vaccines are to be used for you all,
as well as Hisako's parents,

19:54.230 --> 19:56.860
and the other mutants
you can find in the area.

19:56.860 --> 19:58.780
Make sure to be thorough.

19:59.360 --> 20:00.150
Understood.

20:03.570 --> 20:04.910
Looking good!

20:04.910 --> 20:06.790
You both look wonderful.

20:06.790 --> 20:08.500
I think so, too.

20:10.000 --> 20:12.460
Well, now that
everyone's here...

20:13.460 --> 20:14.420
Take a look at this.

20:16.420 --> 20:19.840
This is the area where
several unexplained phenomenon,

20:19.840 --> 20:21.840
believed to be caused by mutants,
have occurred.

20:22.760 --> 20:24.590
They seem to all be spanning out
from a central point...

20:25.010 --> 20:28.310
Somewhere in the mountains,
a place that's uninhabited.

20:29.310 --> 20:31.770
Whatever's blocking Cerebro,

20:31.770 --> 20:34.860
and the source of all these
secondary mutations is probably there.

20:34.860 --> 20:35.520
That's right.

20:35.980 --> 20:37.480
Investigate it carefully.

20:37.940 --> 20:39.320
Alright, let's move.

20:39.320 --> 20:40.070
C'mon, Hisako.

20:41.860 --> 20:42.700
Charles...

20:43.410 --> 20:45.240
are you sure there isn't anything else
you want us to investigate?

20:45.990 --> 20:47.370
What do you mean?

20:48.740 --> 20:51.250
I'm talking about Yui Sasaki.

20:52.960 --> 20:55.250
You read my mind...

20:55.250 --> 20:59.880
When you look into someone's mind,
you're connected psychically.

20:59.880 --> 21:02.840
Even things you want to keep
hidden are likely to be seen.

21:04.840 --> 21:09.350
But if you'd rather not go into it,
I won't press the issue.

21:14.560 --> 21:15.150
<i>She's right...</i>

21:15.850 --> 21:18.520
<i>I am hiding something,
out of fear.</i>

21:19.230 --> 21:23.070
<i>Because the foe we
may be facing could well</i>

21:23.070 --> 21:26.870
<i>be beyond our
wildest imagination...</i>

23:03.800 --> 23:08.260
The X-Men return to Tohoku,
under Professor X's orders.

23:09.090 --> 23:14.260
A fierce battle erupts with
the remnants of the U-Men.

23:15.060 --> 23:16.930
Facing down superior technology,

23:16.930 --> 23:20.690
and thoroughly analyzed data
on their fighting capacity,

23:20.690 --> 23:23.610
the X-Men face
complete annihilation.

23:23.610 --> 23:26.030
Will they survive?

23:26.610 --> 23:31.070
<b><i>Conflict - Fierce Fight</i></b>

23:26.690 --> 23:28.650
Next time on X-Men...

23:28.650 --> 23:29.400
Battle.
